---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Блог
description: Полезни статии за дограма, монтаж, обръщане на прозорци и избор на системи.
---
{% from "macros/page-banner.njk" import pageBanner %}
{% from "macros/breadcrumbs.njk" import breadcrumbs %}

{% call pageBanner() %}
  <div class="eyebrow text-brand before:bg-brand">Полезно</div>
  <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-black leading-none">Блог</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">Съвети и разяснения, които помагат преди да изберете дограма.</p>
{% endcall %}

{{ breadcrumbs([
  { label: "Начало", url: "/" },
  { label: "Блог" }
]) }}

<section class="section-pad bg-brand-mist">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    {% for a in blog %}
      <a class="card reveal group block no-underline" href="{{ ('/blog/' + a.slug + '/') | url }}">
        <div class="relative m-3 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
          <img class="image-cover" src="{{ a.image }}" alt="{{ a.title }}" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink/10 px-5 pb-6 pt-4">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand">
            <span>{{ a.category }}</span>
            <span class="text-ink-faint">{{ a.date }}</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink group-hover:text-brand">{{ a.title }}</h2>
          <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">{{ a.excerpt }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
